        {
          "id": 1035629005,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It would probably be useful in verbose mode to add a comment after running `add_selection` about whether the selected packets are being excluded from the file or are the ones that will be written.\n\nI assume that most people who put `-r` with no packet numbers are probably confusing it with the `-r` option to read a file in tshark. There's a case for making it something like `-R` instead.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
